---
description: OpenMediaForge product, architecture, security, and GUI rules
alwaysApply: true
---

OpenMediaForge is a clean-room, local-first, provider-neutral AI media command desk.

Do not copy or depend on MuAPI/Open-Generative-AI architecture.
Do not hardcode a single hosted compute gateway.
Every provider must be an adapter.
Every model must be a manifest.
Every generation must create a job and receipt.
BYOK must flow through KeyRail credential refs and execution tickets.
Raw keys must not be stored in job or receipt records.
Mock provider must work without API keys.
Provider placeholders must be honest and not pretend to run real compute.
The GUI must be high-style, creator-grade, dark-first, cinematic, fast, and professional.
Run verify before claiming done.
